; Every message of Tauri's NSIS template. A file named in customLanguageFiles replaces Tauri's own
; file for its language, so it must define every string, or that text is blank in the installer.
LangString addOrReinstall ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "添加或重新安装组件"
LangString alreadyInstalled ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "已安装"
LangString alreadyInstalledLong ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "已安装 ${PRODUCTNAME} ${VERSION}。请选择要执行的操作，然后点击“下一步”。"
LangString appRunning ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "${PRODUCTNAME} 正在运行。请先关闭它，然后重试。"
LangString appRunningOkKill ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "${PRODUCTNAME} 正在运行。$\n点击“确定”关闭它。"
LangString chooseMaintenanceOption ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "请选择要执行的维护选项。"
LangString chooseHowToInstall ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "请选择 ${PRODUCTNAME} 的安装方式。"
LangString createDesktop ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "创建桌面快捷方式"
LangString dontUninstall ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "不卸载"
LangString dontUninstallDowngrade ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "不卸载（此安装程序必须先卸载，才能安装较旧的版本）"
LangString failedToKillApp ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法关闭 ${PRODUCTNAME}。请先关闭它，然后重试。"
LangString installingWebview2 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "正在安装 WebView2..."
LangString newerVersionInstalled ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "已安装较新版本的 ${PRODUCTNAME}，不建议安装旧版本。如果确实要安装这个旧版本，最好先卸载当前版本。请选择要执行的操作，然后点击“下一步”。"
LangString older ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "较旧"
LangString olderOrUnknownVersionInstalled ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "这台电脑已安装 ${PRODUCTNAME} 的 $R4 版本。建议先卸载当前版本再安装。请选择要执行的操作，然后点击“下一步”。"
LangString silentDowngrades ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "此安装程序无法在静默模式下安装较旧的版本，请改用图形界面安装。$\n"
LangString unableToUninstall ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法卸载。"
LangString uninstallApp ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "卸载 ${PRODUCTNAME}"
LangString uninstallBeforeInstalling ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "安装前先卸载"
LangString unknown ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "未知"
LangString webview2AbortError ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法安装 WebView2。没有 WebView2，此程序无法运行。请重新运行安装程序。"
LangString webview2DownloadError ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "错误：无法下载 WebView2 - $0"
LangString webview2DownloadSuccess ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "已下载 WebView2 安装程序"
LangString webview2Downloading ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "正在下载 WebView2 安装程序..."
LangString webview2InstallError ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "错误：WebView2 安装失败，退出代码 $1"
LangString webview2InstallSuccess ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "已安装 WebView2"
LangString deleteAppData ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "同时删除已下载的模型、运行环境和项目数据（不勾选则保留）"
